{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22460","headline":"花下对酒二首 一 · 白居易","name":"花下对酒二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蔼蔼江气春，南宾闰正月。\n梅樱与桃杏，次第城上发。\n红房烂簇火，素艳纷团雪。\n香惜委风飘，愁牵压枝折。\n楼中老太守，头上新白发。\n冷澹病心情，暄和好时节。\n故园音信断，远郡亲宾绝。\n欲问花前尊，依然爲谁设。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22460.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22460","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}